{'symbol': 'FE', 'date': '2023-02-08 14:35:00', 'title': 'POTOMAC EDISON COMPLETES 2022 SERVICE RELIABILITY PROJECTS TO ENHANCE ELECTRIC SYSTEM RELIABILITY AND PERFORMANCE; PLANS MORE IN 2023', 'text': 'WILLIAMSPORT, MD. , FEB. 8, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- POTOMAC EDISON, A SUBSIDIARY OF FIRSTENERGY CORP. (NYSE: FE), INVESTED NEARLY $10 MILLION IN 2022 TO COMPLETE SERVICE RELIABILITY PROJECTS THAT WILL HELP ENHANCE ELECTRIC SERVICE AND MINIMIZE THE IMPACT OF POWER OUTAGES FOR THOUSANDS OF CUSTOMERS IN MARYLAND.'}